<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA BEAT WEST INDIES BY NINE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA BEAT WEST INDIES BY NINE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia beat West Indies by nine wickets in a rain-shortened limited overs match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores - West Indies 127 for eight in 31 overs (J.Adams 48 not out); Western Australia 128 for one in 19.2 overs (R.Campbell 64 not out, D.Martyn 51 not out).</p>
